<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-032" chapter-id="c-jinshu-032-chu-lingyuan" source-id="s-jinshu-032-chu-lingyuan">
  <p id="c-jinshu-032-chu-lingyuan:line096" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-032-chu-lingyuan:line096:m0000" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAD">恭思褚皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-jinshu-032-chu-lingyuan:line096:m0006" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAD">靈媛</persName>，河南陽翟人，義興太守<persName id="c-jinshu-032-chu-lingyuan:line096:m0019" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAA">爽</persName>之女也。后初為<persName id="c-jinshu-032-chu-lingyuan:line096:m0027" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAD">琅邪王妃</persName>。元熙元年，立為皇后，生<persName id="c-jinshu-032-chu-lingyuan:line096:m0043" ref="nkt_vst_edi">海鹽</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-032-chu-lingyuan:line096:m0046" ref="yx5_lnv_eq9">富陽公主</persName>。及<persName id="c-jinshu-032-chu-lingyuan:line096:m0052" ref="ije_ngm_cmj">帝</persName>禪位于宋，降為<persName id="c-jinshu-032-chu-lingyuan:line096:m0060" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAD">零陵王妃</persName>。宋元嘉十三年崩，時年五十三，祔葬沖平陵。</p>
</text>
